                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "At surface level, this feels like a futuristic [url=store.steampowered.com/app/11020/TrackMania_Nations_Forever/]TrackMania[/url] with some more tricks and mechanics to play with. It has fun and crazy tracks (including workshop support), and a lot of opportunities to do cool stunts with your car.\n\nBut where this game really shines is in its main campaign and its atmosphere. This has one of the best audio and visual effects experiences I've ever seen in any car game, or in any game at all! The transitions when you teleport are so damn cool, and the soundtrack is also a banger! Seriously, this game's campaign is such a great and chilling experience, it's really worth playing!\n",
